## Configuration

Flags override environment variables. See [docs/configuration.md](docs/configuration.md).

| Flag | Variable | Default | Meaning |
|---|---|---|---|
| `--tasks` | `{{env_prefix}}_TASKS` | built-in sample | JSON file of tasks to show |
| `--log-file` | `{{env_prefix}}_LOG_FILE` | none | Append JSON logs to this file |
| `--log-level` | `{{env_prefix}}_LOG_LEVEL` | `info` | `debug`, `info`, `warn` or `error` |
| `--no-tui` | | off | Print text and exit |
| `--json` | | off | Print JSON and exit; errors are JSON on stderr |

`NO_COLOR` turns colors off.

## Development

Requires Go, make, a C compiler (for the race detector) and [golangci-lint](https://golangci-lint.run/).

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make build` | Build `bin/{{project_slug}}` |
| `make test` | Unit, golden-frame and headless program tests |
| `make test-integration` | Run the built binary without a terminal |
| `make golden` | Rewrite the golden frames after a view change |
| `make lint` | golangci-lint |
| `make smoke` | `--help`, `--version` and the text fallback |
| `make ci` | Everything CI runs |

See [docs/DEVELOPMENT.md](docs/DEVELOPMENT.md) and [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

